# Apex 26 — Cursor entry

- **Rules:** root `AGENTS.md` (canonical); `CLAUDE.md` only imports it. Coordination: AGENTS.md §Coordination. Path rules: edit `.claude/rules/*.md`, then `npm run gen` (never hand-edit generated `.mdc` twins).
- **Skills / subagents:** `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` and `.claude/agents/*.md` (shared). Codex: `.agents/skills/<name>` via `bash tools/env/mirror-skills.sh` — lockstep, never fork. No `.cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/agents/` unless Cursor-only.
- **Route:** deploy/`version.json` → `deploy-research`; pre-push → `verify-agent` (`--base <ref>`); live canvas → `mcp-probe`; host browser → `playwright-official`; bloat → `slim-bloat` / `code-hunter` (focus dead-code). No `mcp-probe` for version.json.
- **MCP:** six servers in `.mcp.json` / `.cursor/mcp.json` (`apex-tools`, `playwright-official`, `chrome-devtools`, `js-debugger`, `apex-lsp`, `browserstack`); plugins → `mcpPluginServerAllowlist`. Catalog does **not** auto-load — `tools/mcp/apex-tools-mcp.sh call`, `tools/mcp/chrome-devtools-mcp.sh`, `probe-mcp.py chrome-start` (CLI-only). Map: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md`.
- **Cursor Cloud:** `composer-2.5` for routine jobs; Grok 7 for hard jobs only
  (confirm its exact Cursor slug at launch — do not invent one); never `default`
  or Auto. Namespaces: `cursor*` plus six repo servers after Bootstrap §3; bare `cursor*` only → CLI fallbacks, re-Save when `environment-info` shows nameless `bash` rows. For subscriptions and drafter/steward endings, follow `.claude/skills/steward/references/vendors.md`; discover the actual host tools before calling them.
- **PR lifecycle and native PR tools:** `.claude/skills/steward/references/vendors.md`.
- **Token hygiene:** one skill per task; prefer `__apex` / `verify-track` / `test:tooling-fast` before screenshots or browser groups. Bootstrap / Cloud MCP: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md` §Bootstrap.
